      "content": "also, scan through the internal memos regarding \"operational efficiency reforms\" that were attached to the draft set. some of the higher-ups have been talking about moving toward more \"transparent\" or rule-based logic systems for our forecasting models to satisfy the new transparency requirements. see if there's anything in there about how that would affect our current deployment structure.",
